о) он ответил (следующим образом): «Нет, клянусь Аллахом, я никогда не возьму (этот перстень), раз его выбросил Посланник Аллаха ﷺ»","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07ed7","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5473,"bookHadithIndex":88,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07ed8","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5474,"bookHadithIndex":89,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07ed9","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5475,"bookHadithIndex":90,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07eda","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5476,"bookHadithIndex":91,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07edb","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5477,"bookHadithIndex":92,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07edc","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5478,"bookHadithIndex":93,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07edd","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5479,"bookHadithIndex":94,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07ede","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5480,"bookHadithIndex":95,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07edf","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5481,"bookHadithIndex":96,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07ee0","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5482,"bookHadithIndex":97,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07ee1","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5483,"bookHadithIndex":98,"text":"Передают со слов Ибн Шихаба, (передавшего) от Анаса ибн Малика (да будет доволен им Аллах) о том, что «в один из дней он увидел на руке Посланника Аллаха ﷺ перстень из серебра».(Анас) сказал: «И люди также сделали (для себя) перстни из серебра и надели их (на пальцы), однако Пророк ﷺ выбросил свой перстень, и тогда люди также выбросили свои перстни»","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07ee2","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5484,"bookHadithIndex":99,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c3c9dd1a4c9c86f07ee3","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":37,"hadithIndex":5485,"bookHadithIndex":100,"text":"","grades":[]}]}